{"version":1,"content":"<p>面向追求響應速度、低延遲與更強私隱控制用户的 Windows 11 修改版作業系統 AtlasOS，在時隔一年後推出全新版本 Atlas 0.6。此次更新引入了全新的 Atlas Manager 應用，使用户無需重新安裝 Windows，即可從舊版本升級到最新系統，同時大幅簡化了安裝介質製作流程。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587616.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.501407+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:36:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:26.487129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:26.487129+00:00","content_hash":"64326a95755d1a86f16590b86440f86dcaf65ee05fee86af4b989dc0d7e8c5db","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}